; The Hyperbolic Time Chamber's door in the ten-day wait (docs/time-chamber.md), applied by wait_chamber.json. From
; Cell's TV announcement (story flag 157) the Lookout's chamber door (zone 9 area 3, trigger 0: "You cannot enter the
; Hyperbolic Time Chamber.") lets the players in: fade, warp into the open area (zone 15 area 18,
; data/maps/chamber_open.json, src/coop/chamber.c); its door leads back to this room at any time. The old room (zone 15
; area 2) stays only for the Vegeta vs Trunks duel, the ten rounds are retired (decision 5). Mr. Popo stands aside the
; door in the wait and points the players to it. Speakers: 0 narration, 82 Mr. Popo.

; ---- the door -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

sequence lk_tc_door
  script                                 ; after Cell's announcement -> 3 (in), else 1 (stock refusal)
        PlayAudio 50
        StackTestStoryFlag 157
        JumpIfFalse L1
        PushByte 3
        END
      L1:
        PushByte 1
        END
  stock @083dd604                        ; "You cannot enter the Hyperbolic Time Chamber."
  stop
  script
        PlayAudio 10
        FadeOut 60
        WaitFrames 20
        WarpToMapWithEntities 15, 18, 1, 1016, 1272
        FadeFromWhite 60
end

; ---- Mr. Popo in the wait -------------------------------------------------------------------------

; the stock Popo (record 0) until Cell's announcement; the new one (beside the door) after it
script lk_popo_stock_cond
        StackTestStoryFlag 143
        StackTestStoryFlagNot 158
        And
        StackTestStoryFlagNot 157
        And
end

script lk_popo_cond
        StackTestStoryFlag 157
        StackTestStoryFlagNot 158
        And
end

sequence lk_popo
  text 82 "MR. POPO: Goku and Gohan have finished their training.\x0bThe Hyperbolic Time Chamber is free now.\x0bMr. Popo has made it ready for you: six rooms, and a gate with six lights.\x0bBeat a room, throw its switch, and a light goes out. Outside, it gets harder."
  text 82 "Go through the door whenever you are ready.\x0bYou may walk out at any time, and come back as often as you like."
end
